00:12:04.310 --> 00:12:06.100
And now I changed
the code there.

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:07.960
So now what happens
in the case, right?

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:09.850
So this is really where
Kubernetes starts to excel,

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:10.350
right?

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:11.560
Like we've updated our code.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:12.935
What we want to
do now is we want

00:12:12.935 --> 00:12:14.872
to rebuild our container image.

00:12:14.872 --> 00:12:16.330
We want to push
