00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:17.620
to the Container Registry.

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:20.230
And then we want to
update our Hello node

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:21.790
to the new version of code.

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:24.280
So I'll do that right now.

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:25.645
The quick commands can do that.

00:12:25.645 --> 00:12:28.700
We go right here where we have
a Docker build command here.

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:29.620
And then we have this.

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:31.630
And then I'll sort
of do all that.

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:35.350
So first section is
we build the image.

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:37.870
We actually push the image up.

00:12:37.870 --> 00:12:40.680
This next command here,
right here, which is kube

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:42.100
controls set image deployment.

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:43.660
Hello node.

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:48.430
Set it to the new V2 version
of the container registry image

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:49.600
that we just pushed up.

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:51.760
So that's essentially
what we're doing there.

00:12:51.760 --> 00:12:53.390
If I get the
deployment it will say,

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:59.530
hey, there's four up and
running if I do a get pods.

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:02.800
Yeah, we see that, hey, the
